abstract: >-
  Manifests, adapted container images and a guide for coding agents that
  walks a researcher through deploying their own DraCor instance (API,
  website, MCP server) on the Cloud Container Platform of the EOSC EU Node.
  Developed with the help of Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic). The DraCorOS
  project is funded as a cascading grant by OSCARS. The authors acknowledge
  the OSCARS project, which has received funding from the European
  Commission's Horizon Europe Research and Innovation programme under grant
  agreement No. 101129751.
